B.a8J=s(["Ask the customer for the part numbers if you want to check them before you go.","On arrival, check the parts are the right ones and are ready.","If the parts are wrong, take a clear photo of the part, then you can cancel for customer fault (a note of at least 10 characters is required). You receive 20% of the job price, shared as described in 'How payouts work'.","If the parts are not ready or nobody is there after you have waited 10 minutes, you can cancel the same way."],t.s)
B.Wq=new A.dp(B.a8J)
