B.V7=new A.bb("m-bidding-laboronly","Labor-only jobs: how to bid","The customer supplies the parts. Quote labor only.",B.a5F)
B.XB=new A.aZ("Bid the realistic hours the diagnosis takes and your honest hourly rate. Once accepted, the hours and price are fixed. You cannot add time later.")
