B.a9C=s(["A good rating from several mechanics is a good sign.","A new customer is not a bad sign. Everyone starts somewhere. Be clear and keep everything in the app.","Customers who describe the problem clearly and respond quickly are usually easier to work with.","Be careful with anyone who wants cash, off-app payment or work before approval."],t.s)
