B.a8_=s(["Customer cancels after paying, before work started: 20% of the amount held is the cancellation fee. YCYC takes its usual share and you receive the rest.","Customer cancels after work started: 50% fee, shared the same way.","Customer-fault cancellation by you (wrong parts, parts not ready, or the customer not there or not responding 10 minutes after your arrival): 20% of the job price, of which YCYC keeps 5% and you receive 15%.","Reschedule approved by you: 20% (you have arrived), 10% (you are on the way), 5% (not set off) of the job price. YCYC keeps its 5% in the arrival and on-the-way cases.","You cancel, or you do not show up: no fee, and the customer is not charged."],t.s)
