B.VY=new A.bb("c-start-diagnostic","Not sure what is wrong? Ask for a diagnostic","Pay a mechanic to find the problem first, then decide on the repair.",B.a7o)
B.Z3=new A.aZ("Bids appear on your job as mechanics send them. Only you can see them; mechanics cannot see each other's prices.")
B.XL=new A.aZ("Tap a mechanic's card to open their profile: reviews, years of experience, certifications, whether they carry insurance, mobile or shop, warranty, and more.")
B.Yo=new A.aZ("There is no rush. A low price is not the only thing that matters. See 'Choosing a mechanic' for tips.")
B.a67=s([B.Z3,B.XL,B.Yo],t.f)
B.VL=new A.bb("c-start-bids","Reading and comparing bids","Price, arrival time, and the mechanic profile.",B.a67)
B.a8X=s(["Open the bid you like and tap 'Accept & pay'.","Review the total. It is the job price plus YCYC's 5% service fee, shown before you confirm.","Pay securely through Stripe. Your card details never touch YCYC's servers."],t.s)
B.Ze=new A.hd(B.a8X)
B.Yf=new A.aZ("Your card is authorized: the money is set aside (it may show as pending on your statement) but it is not paid to the mechanic until you confirm the job is complete, or YCYC releases it as described in the Customer Agreement.")
