B.Za=new A.aZ("Approved extra work is paid for the same way as the main job: held first, released when you confirm.")
B.ZK=new A.hA("Do not agree to extra work or extra payment outside the app. If a mechanic asks for more money in person, ask them to send it as an additional work request, or tell us.")
B.Xt=new A.dO("Diagnostic jobs are different: the hours and price are final, so mechanics cannot add work to a diagnostic.")
