B.a4B=s(["If everything is right, tap 'Review & release payment' and follow the steps to confirm and sign.","Your held payment is then captured and paid out to the mechanic.","Tap 'Leave a review' to rate the mechanic. Honest reviews help other customers."],t.s)
B.Zd=new A.hd(B.a4B)
B.ZN=new A.hA("Report any problem BEFORE you release payment. Once you confirm, the money is paid out. If a job is never confirmed or reported, the hold can be released to the mechanic automatically before your card authorization expires (often about seven days).")
