B.ZV=new A.hA("You are responsible for the parts being the right ones for your vehicle and ready when the mechanic arrives. If the mechanic arrives and the parts are wrong or not ready, or nobody is there to meet them, the mechanic can cancel and you are charged a fee of 20% of the job price. For wrong parts the mechanic must attach a photo of the part, which you can see on the job.")
B.Xh=new A.dO("Not sure a part fits? Check the part number against your vehicle's year, engine and trim before you post, or ask the seller. You can also post a normal job and let the mechanic supply the parts.")
B.a7u=s([B.Ya,B.XM,B.ZV,B.Xh],t.f)
B.W5=new A.bb("c-start-ownparts","Using your own parts (labor-only quote)","Switch on I have my own parts and mechanics quote labor only.",B.a7u)
B.XV=new A.aZ("Settings > My Garage keeps your saved vehicles so you can pick one when posting. Settings > My Address keeps the address where work happens.")
B.XE=new A.aZ("The address is shown to a mechanic only after you accept their bid and your payment is secured, and it is hidden again once the job is done.")
B.a98=s([B.XV,B.XE],t.f)
B.UY=new A.bb("c-start-garage","Your garage and your address","Save vehicles and your address once.",B.a98)
