B.XI=new A.aZ("The fee depends on what your mechanic has already done, as shown by their location check-ins:")
B.a6K=s(["Mechanic has arrived at your address: 20% of the job price.","Mechanic is on the way (including to a parts store) but has not arrived: 10%.","Mechanic has not set off yet: 5%."],t.s)
B.WO=new A.dp(B.a6K)
B.XP=new A.aZ("The fee is charged only if the mechanic approves. It is taken from your payment hold, the rest of the hold is released back to your card, and you pay again to confirm the new time. If the mechanic declines, the job is cancelled and you are not charged.")
