B.YN=new A.aZ("If your mechanic cancels, you are not charged and any hold is released.")
B.YV=new A.aZ("The exception is a labor-only job (you supplied the parts). If the mechanic has arrived at your address and the parts are wrong or not ready, or you were not there, they can cancel and you are charged 20% of the job price. They must tell you what happened, and for wrong parts they must attach a photo.")
B.Y7=new A.aZ("If you think a charge like that is wrong, tap 'Report a concern' on the job and tell us what happened.")
