B.a6a=s(["Open the job and tap 'Track mechanic' to see whether they are on the way.","Tap 'Ask your mechanic to share location'. They get a notification asking them to turn sharing on.","Give a reasonable wait. Delays happen. The app has no chat or phone feature, so you cannot message the mechanic from inside it.","If they truly never arrive, cancel the job and choose 'The mechanic didn't show up'. We check their location record. If it shows they never arrived, you are not charged and they are not paid."],t.s)
B.Zq=new A.hd(B.a6a)
B.X9=new A.dO("You can report a no-show only 30 minutes after the scheduled arrival time. If your mechanic's bid had no time of day, it is about 3 hours after your payment was secured.")
B.Yn=new A.aZ("A mechanic who arrives late is not a no-show. You can let the job go ahead, or cancel; a normal cancellation fee applies if you cancel after paying. If you are unhappy about repeated lateness, tell us with 'Report a concern' and leave an honest review.")
