B.Y2=new A.aZ("The price you accepted is the price. If your mechanic finds more work, they must send an additional work request in the app, and you choose to approve or decline.")
B.Y6=new A.aZ("If they refuse to do the agreed work unless you pay more, cancel with the reason 'The mechanic changed the price or refused the agreed work'. The job is paused for review before any money moves.")
