B.a7f=s(["Card declined: try another card, or contact your bank. YCYC never sees your card number; Stripe handles it.","A pending charge on your statement is the hold. It is not paid out yet, and unused amounts are released.","Payment screen closed early: open the job and tap 'Return to payment'.","Charged but the job still shows 'Payment pending': wait a minute and pull down to refresh. If it persists, email us with the date and amount."],t.s)
