B.ZF=new A.fY("What to do in case of...","Common situations, step by step",B.xg,B.a5X)
B.Ye=new A.aZ("YCYC is a technology platform. We do not perform, supervise or guarantee repair work, and the mechanics are independent businesses, not YCYC employees. The agreement for the repair is between you and the mechanic.")
B.Yl=new A.aZ("Because of that, YCYC cannot endorse any specific mechanic or shop. Badges, verification and reviews are information to help you decide, not a guarantee of any outcome.")
