B.Vk=new A.bb("c-disputes-refunds","Refunds: how they work","Refunds are not guaranteed. Decided case by case, based on evidence.",B.a8j)
B.a5V=s(["Do not release payment while an issue is open.","Collect evidence: dated photos or video, the part or invoice if relevant, and notes of what was agreed and what happened.","Tap 'Report a concern' on the job, or email rayconsumerlabs@gmail.com, and describe: what you expected, what happened, and what you would like us to consider.","Reply promptly and truthfully if we ask questions."],t.s)
B.Zo=new A.hd(B.a5V)
B.XW=new A.aZ("Reporting a safety concern, a request to pay outside the app, or a price or scope disagreement pauses the job and the held payment while YCYC reviews it.")
B.a5Y=s([B.Zo,B.XW],t.f)
B.UZ=new A.bb("c-disputes-report","How to report a problem the right way","Report before you release payment, and keep it in the app.",B.a5Y)
B.a8P=s(["Photos or video of the vehicle before and after, with dates.","The job description, the accepted bid, and any additional work requests, which are all recorded in the app.","The mechanic's progress notes and photos.","Location check-ins (heading to you / arrived), which the app records automatically.","Any invoice or written quote showing what was agreed.","A written opinion from another shop, if you got one."],t.s)
B.WJ=new A.dp(B.a8P)
B.Xk=new A.dO("Evidence works best when it is specific. 'The brake pads were replaced but the rotors still have deep grooves (photo)' is easier to review than 'the work is bad'.")
B.a5z=s([B.WJ,B.Xk],t.f)
B.VJ=new A.bb("c-disputes-evidence","What evidence helps","Clear, dated, and in the app.",B.a5z)
B.XT=new A.aZ("When a problem is reported, YCYC may freeze the job and the held payment while it reviews. We may look at photos, notes, check-ins, confirmations, ratings and anything else in the app's record, and we may ask both sides for more information.")
B.YK=new A.aZ("YCYC may decide, in its reasonable discretion, to release the payment to the mechanic, refund you in full, or split the payment, and may decide who was at fault. YCYC's decision controls how money held through the platform is paid out.")
